---
title: Sequence diagram - Coordinator assigns a request
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Coordinator
  participant UI as Console UI
  participant RS as RequestService
  participant PP as PermissionPolicy
  participant SR as StatusRules
  participant Repo as RequestRepository
  C->>UI: choose request R-0012 and technician T-02
  UI->>RS: assign("R-0012", "T-02", currentUser)
  RS->>PP: can(currentUser, "assign")
  alt user is not Coordinator
    PP-->>RS: false
    RS-->>UI: PermissionError("Only coordinators can assign")
    UI-->>C: show refusal, nothing changed
  else user is Coordinator
    PP-->>RS: true
    RS->>Repo: get("R-0012")
    Repo-->>RS: request (status = Reviewed)
    RS->>SR: canTransition(Reviewed, Assigned, Coordinator)
    alt transition not allowed (e.g. still Submitted)
      SR-->>RS: false
      RS-->>UI: TransitionError("Request must be reviewed first")
      UI-->>C: show refusal, nothing changed
    else transition allowed
      SR-->>RS: true
      RS->>RS: set assignment (T-02, by, time) and status = Assigned
      RS->>RS: add StatusChange to history
      RS->>Repo: save(request)
      Repo-->>RS: ok
      RS-->>UI: updated request
      UI-->>C: "R-0012 assigned to T-02"
    end
  end
